  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save Marine Turtles (SmART): Protecting Endangered Leatherbacks and Other Nesting Marine Turtles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1) conduct a six day training workshop for 12 participants from 3 nesting beach communities to devlelop leaderhsip skills; and 2) conduct skill building clinics to develop technical skills for monitoring beaches; and 3) community members will survey and protect sea turtle nests on three beaches during the leatherback nesting season.</narrative>
  </description>
